    <https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#innerHTML> "<figure class=\"ml-auto max-w-[600px]\">\n <img src=\"https://foerderdatenbank.d-s-e-e.de/volumes/profiles/_article_m/beleben-logo-anniversary.svg\" width=\"800\" height=\"1168\">\n</figure>".
